// (th4) CHI: OVL_PERK_DESC -- perk / synergy / symptom descriptions.
// Structure is load-bearing, not decoration:
//   ::   splits the panel into lines -- the count must match the English exactly.
//   the run of spaces after each :: is COLUMN ALIGNMENT (4 vs 5 indents differ).
//   %i   is printf-substituted at runtime; %% is a literal percent sign.
// Dropping a %i makes printf read off the stack, so every row was checked against
// its English (:: count, specifier order, per-segment indent) BEFORE emit.
// Perk names embedded here match CHI_PerkName -- Perks.cpp:1161 renders
// LocalizedPerkName() inside the requirement lines below.
