// (th4) CHI: OVL_MENU -- SDlg dialog titles, buttons and blurbs, drawn through the
// PCX dialog fonts (Font16/24/30), not MenuEngine.
// Keyed off the UNION of every loc's Menu table, not ES alone: the locs do NOT share
// one key set (ES 150, ID 150, PL 156, PT 128) and they disagree about WHICH 150.
// The trailing CHI-only entries are keys no other loc carries:
//   - the Benefit/Penalty label format (PL has it, ES does not)
//   - three provider requirement strings, keyed on the EXACT literals inside the
//     Storm provider DLL (lib/Standard.sn2) -- they arrive at runtime via
//     SNetEnumGames -> InitProviderDesc and reach the screen through
//     LMenu(selectData->requirements). Extracted from the DLL, not guessed.
//     Note the UDP requirement is NOT the DLL's wording: TH4 overrides it to the
//     "a TCP/IP-compatible" form, which is the key the other locs already use.
// %s / %d and \n are structural and preserved verbatim.
